out.push("\n\n```html\n<li>\n  <a href=\"/collections/clothing\">\n    Clothing\n  </a>\n\n  <button\n    type=\"button\"\n    aria-label=\"Clothing submenu\"\n    aria-expanded=\"false\"\n    aria-controls=\"clothing-submenu\"\n  >\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg>\n  </button>\n\n  <ul id=\"clothing-submenu\" hidden>\n    <!-- Navigation links -->\n  </ul>\n</li>\n```\n\n不要让同一个控件同时承担含义不清晰的页面跳转和展开操作。\n\n### 2.3 JavaScript 实现 Disclosure\n\n```javascript\nconst button = document.querySelector(\n  '[aria-controls=\"clothing-menu\"]'\n);\n\nconst panel = document.getElementById(\n  'clothing-menu'\n);\n\nconst container = button.closest('li');\n\nfunction setOpen(open, restoreFocus = false) {\n  button.setAttribute(\n    'aria-expanded',\n    String(open)\n  );\n\n  if (!open &&\n      (restoreFocus ||\n       panel.contains(document.activeElement))) {\n    button.focus();\n  }\n\n  panel.hidden = !open;\n}\n\nbutton.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  const open =\n    button.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';\n\n  setOpen(!open);\n});\n\ncontainer.addEventListener('keydown', event => {\n  if (\n    event.key === 'Escape' &&\n    !event.defaultPrevented &&\n    button.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true'\n  ) {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    setOpen(false, true);\n  }\n});\n\ncontainer.addEventListener('focusout', event => {\n  if (\n    event.relatedTarget &&\n    !container.contains(event.relatedTarget)\n  ) {\n    setOpen(false);\n  }\n});\n\ndocument.addEventListener('click', event => {\n  if (!container.contains(event.target)) {\n    setOpen(false);\n  }\n});\n```\n\n这个实现具备基本的展开、折叠、Esc 关闭、焦点离开关闭和外部点击关闭能力。\n\n它没有使用 Focus Trap，因为普通导航下拉菜单不是模态弹窗。\n\n### 2.4 键盘导航交互演示\n\n");
