out.push("\n\n---\n\n## 13. Shopify Dawn：Mega Menu 源码解析\n\n源码文件：[snippets/header-mega-menu.liquid](https://github.com/Shopify/dawn/blob/main/snippets/header-mega-menu.liquid)\n\nDawn 并没有为普通 Mega Menu 使用完整的 ARIA Menu 模式，而是基于原生 `details` 和 `summary` 实现。\n\n简化后的结构：\n\n```liquid\n<nav class=\"header__inline-menu\">\n\n  <ul class=\"list-menu\" role=\"list\">\n\n    {% for link in section.settings.menu.links %}\n\n      <li>\n\n        {% if link.links != blank %}\n\n          <header-menu>\n\n            <details class=\"mega-menu\">\n\n              <summary>\n                {{ link.title | escape }}\n              </summary>\n\n              <div class=\"mega-menu__content\">\n\n                <ul role=\"list\">\n\n                  {% for childlink in link.links %}\n\n                    <li>\n                      <a href=\"{{ childlink.url }}\"\n                        {% if childlink.current %}\n                          aria-current=\"page\"\n                        {% endif %}\n                      >\n                        {{ childlink.title | escape }}\n                      </a>\n                    </li>\n\n                  {% endfor %}\n\n                </ul>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </details>\n\n          </header-menu>\n\n        {% else %}\n\n          <a href=\"{{ link.url }}\">\n            {{ link.title | escape }}\n          </a>\n\n        {% endif %}\n\n      </li>\n\n    {% endfor %}\n\n  </ul>\n\n</nav>\n```\n\n以上是根据 Dawn 公开源码简化的教学结构，省略了三级导航、样式及部分属性。");
